{"id":8834730787015,"title":"Winter Cardinal on Berry Branch Patchwork Christmas Quilt","handle":"winter-cardinal-on-berry-branch-patchwork-christmas-quilt-43ecda62b6-43ecda62b6","description":"\u003cp\u003eAdd a cozy touch of winter beauty to your home with this beautiful custom quilt by Jeminise. Featuring a lovely watercolor illustration of a cardinal perched on a berry branch, this bedding piece brings the warmth and charm of nature indoors. Perfect for the holiday season or year-round comfort, it can also be customized with your own text or name, making it a truly thoughtful gift for your loved ones or a special addition to your guest bedroom.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePersonalized Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Customize your quilt with your own text or name for a unique, personal touch.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWinter Cardinal Artwork:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features a realistic watercolor illustration of a cardinal on a berry branch with leaves, berries, and snow.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoft \u0026amp; Comfortable:\u003c\/strong\u003e Made with a breathable polyester outer layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for consecutive warmth.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Perfect as a bed quilt, throw blanket, picnic mat, or cozy companion for camping and outdoor trips.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine washable in cold water and quick-drying to keep it fluffy and clean.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOptional Pillowcases:\u003c\/strong\u003e Complete your bedding set by choosing to add matching custom pillowcases.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eBrand\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u00